# Errors

## EXTERNAL_MODULES_CANNOT_BE_TRANSFORMED_TO_MODULES

```text
[EXTERNAL_MODULES_CANNOT_BE_TRANSFORMED_TO_MODULES] "lib.js" is resolved as a module now, but it was an external module before.
  │ 
  │ Help: Make all imports of this module resolve the same way: all as external, or all as non-external.

